    "sections": {
        "description": "Mineral Industry Theme is designed with structured sections for presenting information about mining operations, mineral resources, industrial services, projects, and company activities. A Mining Company can use dedicated areas to display services, project details, company information, and contact options. The layout also provides space for a Mining Contractor to explain its services and completed projects. Content sections can present technical information related to a Mining Engineer, while project pages can organize details about Mineral Exploration activities. Images, text blocks, service sections, and project highlights help create a clear presentation of business information. The Mineral Industry Theme can also accommodate content covering Coal Mining operations, Gold Mining projects, or Metal Mining activities. For a Quarrying Business, dedicated sections can display site information, available services, equipment details, and contact information. The responsive structure adapts content to different screen sizes, while organized navigation supports access to important pages. Customizable typography, colors, images, and homepage sections allow businesses to maintain a consistent visual layout. Blog or news sections can also be used for publishing industry updates, project announcements, and company-related information."
    },
